ame>Becattini</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Brighton</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Selby</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Kamphuisen</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name> (<year>2008</year>) <article-title>Cardiovascular risk factors and venous thromboembolism: a meta-analysis</article-title>. <source>Circulation</source><volume>117</volume>: <fpage>93</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>102</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18086925</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pmed.1001310-Undas1"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Undas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Brummel-Ziedins</surname><given-names>KE</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Mann</surname><given-names>KG</given-names></name> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>Statins and blood coagulation</article-title>. <source>Arterioscler Thromb Vasc Biol</source><volume>25</volume>: <fpage>287</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>294</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15569822</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pmed.1001310-SenBanerjee1"><label>12</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Sen-Banerjee</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Mir</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Hamik</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Atkins</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>Kruppel-like factor 2 as a novel mediator of statin effects in endothelial cells</article-title>. <source>Circulation</source><volume>112</volume>: <fpage>720</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>726</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16043642</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pmed.1001310-Tehrani1"><label>13</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Tehrani</surname><given-nam